	(text "Two-transistor astable multivibrator, LEDs flash alternately." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "74cc3914-c837-4981-af29-9a1627938c6a"))
	(text "f = 1 / (1.386 * Rb * C) = 1.5 Hz with Rb = 47k, C = 10 uF.  Supply 3 to 9 V (5 V recommended)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3ba9a850-cf97-4fba-9172-c2f2e49bfb81"))
	(text "Every R / C / LED / Q position is a hybrid footprint: fit the THT part OR the 0805 / SOT-23 part." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0ac75c69-f97b-4ce2-be04-fdba526c6842"))
	(text "JP1..JP4 select the TO-92 outer-leg pinout: bridged 1-2 (factory) = E-B-C (2N3904, PN2222, S8050);" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1ad8d7c4-0c57-4803-b77d-23cfb3278e5f"))
	(text "cut 1-2 and bridge 2-3 = C-B-E (BC547, BC548, BC337). SOT-23 parts ignore the jumpers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9aa6d066-530a-4d06-b8e2-f4d6eb7a33a2"))
	(text "Pinout select (per transistor): pad 1 = GND (E), pad 2 = TO-92 outer leg, pad 3 = collector" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 107.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ae5c012c-9252-4bcf-ae14-118526813562"))
